Design notes:
  - OP: virtual node, soft-matched from 5 static prototypes (EDA)
  - 3 physical nodes: LOW_FREQ / BPF / 2xBPF (B4 的 BPF 拆分已撤回)
  - CONDITION edges: broadcast operating context to frequency nodes
  - DRIFT edges: energy coupling (vortex <-> blade-pass modulation), non-harmonic
  - HARMONIC edge: BPF → 2×BPF (r=2.0), sole deterministic relationship;
    r_obs 在合并带上是带内能量加权 IF 的比值, class 2 读到 ≈2.2 (诊断口径)
  - No self-loops; no classifier-based condition prediction

